I noticed a few other effects:

      1) It causes your teleports to fail occasionally
      2) It curses items at random
      3) The cost of casting a spell is increased by a factor of 5
      4) It gives you limited Clairvoyance.

These occured while I was in possession of the Amulet.
Although I do not know for certain, some other hack players
I know said that the Amulet would have the same effect when worn.

Also, do not polymorph the Amulet of Yendor. It turns into a 
normal amulet and you will not be able to enter the endgame.

